abstract: >-
  A unified theory of everything built from a single axiom — the One — using
  one operation: the fold (double and cast out the One). From this alone, with
  zero free parameters, the framework forces the four fundamental forces, the
  full Standard-Model particle spectrum, gravity, cosmology, and consciousness
  as self-observation, and confirms each against measurement. The fine-structure
  constant is counted (1/alpha = 2^7 + 3^2(251/250) = 137.036), the absolute
  scale is forced through the Planck hierarchy at 2^(127/2), and the discovery
  frontier predicts two new forces, twelve Smithions (the lightest the dark
  matter), Smithium at element 126, and a periodic table ending at element 137.
  No measured value is an input to any construction; measurements appear only as
  the after-the-fact arbiter. Every result is proven by construction in a
  permitted language enforced by a static gate, verified by 1,058 machine-checked
  tests, and the entire corpus reproduces from a single command.
